Package: zikr
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, gir1.2-notify-0.7, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1, speech-dispatcher | espeak-ng
Maintainer: shamsbd71 <https://github.com/shamsbd71>
Homepage: https://github.com/shamsbd71/zikr
Description: A quiet dhikr reminder for your desktop
 Zikr speaks a short remembrance of Allah aloud at random moments
 throughout the day - Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, Allahu Akbar, and
 others. Lives in the system tray. No accounts, no ads, no tracking.
